Spoiler warning.

Out of arena:
  1. Get small black box with red button.
  2. Activate it.

Picking up:
  1. Use "get" = "g".

Mounting horse:
  1. Feed the horse the appropriate type of food.
  2. Talk to it.

Money:
  1. "They say the autoteller is buggy."
  2. Stuff can be sold at the pawnshop.
  3. Winning at the arena carries a financial prize.

Surviving and general stuff:
  1. Omega has some SERIOUS bugs.  Save your game every 2 or 3 levels, 
and make backups in case the program hangs (not to be used for cheating,
OBVIOUSLY).
  2. When you start out, find the pawnshop.  Sometimes you can get very
nice weapons, armor, or other stuff there cheap.
  3. Don't fight in the arena without armor and a weapon.
  4. It is much easier to be chaotic than lawful.
  5. Some things can only be uncursed by your deity.
 
